Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.13,0:00:04.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 真月！ 喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.85,0:00:06.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[无线电](真月)快点 快点过来 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.82,0:00:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.79,0:00:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着我。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这… 这是。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.34,0:00:21.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.78,0:00:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)你来了啊 游马巡查。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.08,0:00:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。 不过 这家伙是？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.37,0:00:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)碍事的来了啊。胜负就先搁一边吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.26,0:00:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈。站住 贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.53,0:00:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 真月。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.01,0:00:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月 喂 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.98,0:00:46.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.35,0:00:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙 到底是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.81,0:00:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙是我们长年追查的最凶恶的异晶人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.85,0:00:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.76,0:00:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.63,0:01:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马巡查，我去追那家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.69,0:01:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不在的期间这个世界的和平就交给你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.99,0:01:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是，真月警部。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.49,0:01:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡寄存在你那里。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.89,0:01:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:18.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}它一定会成为你的力量的。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.29,0:01:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然有5张。这也是巴利安的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想你应该明白{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.17,0:01:28.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}关于这些卡的事，对Astral也
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.44,0:01:30.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}请你保密。好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.87,0:01:33.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……啊啊。但是真月{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.14,0:01:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}差不多也该对Astral那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.09,0:01:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说了吧……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.47,0:01:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.79,0:01:40.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在如果我的真实身份暴露了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.43,0:01:42.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会让Astral陷入
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.77,0:01:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}危险的境地。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.88,0:01:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光……。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.06,0:01:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总有一天，我会把一切都说出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.35,0:01:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那之前，请你相信我。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.54,0:01:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了，真月警部！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.37,0:01:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托你了，游马巡查。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.49,0:03:41.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)九十九游马和星光。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.27,0:03:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在人间界身负重伤的阿里特和基拉古。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.89,0:03:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}至今仍未醒来。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.62,0:03:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)米扎艾尔，事已至此，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.70,0:03:53.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就由我们两人来做个了断吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.76,0:03:56.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:04:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}摆着一副臭脸，是想来忏悔吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.71,0:04:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要不要本大爷贝库塔来听听啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.67,0:04:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.51,0:04:10.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.44,0:04:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～啊，真难看啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.10,0:04:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力有不及，什么结果都没能留下。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.82,0:04:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是想说请原谅我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.83,0:04:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就原谅你吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.02,0:04:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手，米扎艾尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.11,0:04:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在不是我们内斗的时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.57,0:04:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下次我不会再拦着了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.48,0:04:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那还真是多谢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.41,0:04:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔，你还真是一如既往地神出鬼没啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.00,0:04:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}利用菲卡博士和托隆{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.70,0:04:53.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}摧毁星光界你的计划。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.20,0:04:57.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是被游马和星光给阻止了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.71,0:05:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你连失败的责任都不负，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.04,0:05:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}躲到哪里去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.44,0:05:09.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不是什么失败。这也是计划的一部分。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.45,0:05:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马、星光、快斗、凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.07,0:05:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了将那群家伙四人一举击溃的最终决战啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝不会有万分之一失手的可能。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.00,0:05:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们几个 赌上吧 把一切押在我身上。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁会信你这家伙的计策。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.89,0:05:29.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.58,0:05:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 别再擅自耍花样了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.82,0:05:37.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果 再发生那种事我本人就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.66,0:05:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔哼哼哼…… 来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:44.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我们来干点不正经的事吧！！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.17,0:05:51.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有了从真月那里拿到的 这张卡和
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.36,0:05:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望光线V的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.03,0:05:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}简直就是无敌啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.41,0:05:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赶紧用这张卡 去收拾屏障怪……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.02,0:05:59.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)你那么起劲干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.22,0:06:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}鳥{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.05,0:06:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯西)瞒着我们偷偷摸摸的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.35,0:06:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)你鬼鬼祟祟干什么呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.75,0:06:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)说到底游马君就是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.93,0:06:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)藏不住事儿的啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.07,0:06:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)喂～ 出来吧～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.40,0:06:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安 躲哪儿去了啦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.27,0:06:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安什么的 就由我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.16,0:06:25.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唰地一下打倒给你看。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.58,0:06:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的… 为什么非得带着
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.72,0:06:29.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这帮家伙去巡逻啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.16,0:06:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家都是想帮游马出份力嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.84,0:06:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.90,0:06:36.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦 那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.03,0:06:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什…什么？ 那玩意儿。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟？ 大家没事吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.80,0:07:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦。没事的啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.49,0:07:08.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出什么事了？ 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.10,0:07:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 啊啊 那个…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.83,0:07:16.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.36,0:07:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾名乃贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.05,0:07:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安最强的战士。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.39,0:07:25.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔 就是那个！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.08,0:07:29.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((那家伙就是我们长年追踪的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.21,0:07:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最凶恶的异晶人贝库塔))
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.88,0:07:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马 星光体{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.56,0:07:41.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连你们一起我要把这个世界上的一切都摧毁！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.99,0:07:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.86,0:07:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 让大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.23,0:07:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.85,0:07:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家 快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.55,0:07:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶界领域 展开！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.14,0:08:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.53,0:08:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和你们决斗真是好久没干了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.87,0:08:15.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么好久没干！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.08,0:08:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我根本就不认识你。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.00,0:08:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你忘了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.86,0:08:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺走Dr.菲卡的身体{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.92,0:08:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和你们进行了一场愉快的决斗啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.79,0:08:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.77,0:08:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你操纵了Dr.菲卡…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.46,0:08:31.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是巴利安吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.61,0:08:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还记得我，真是荣幸啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.50,0:08:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把一切彻底击溃。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.61,0:08:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不只是星光界。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.54,0:08:43.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个世界的一切也是！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.11,0:08:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.14,0:08:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连这个世界也…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.44,0:08:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我怎么可能让你为所欲为！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.49,0:08:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.38,0:09:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.78,0:09:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 让我们开始做些不妙的事吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.97,0:09:08.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.50,0:09:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻就由我来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.34,0:09:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.28,0:09:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 暗影食尸鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.29,0:09:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后发动暗影食尸鬼的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.18,0:09:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这只怪兽的攻击力变为０{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.68,0:09:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌特殊召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.45,0:09:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力０的暗影怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧，暗影·安福姆！
