Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的力场里有 3只怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.84,0:17:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我们的力场里…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.91,0:17:29.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有霍普的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也没法升阶啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.04,0:17:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.29,0:17:35.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.86,0:17:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.74,0:17:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.00,0:17:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 不能放弃啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信……相信卡组吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.94,0:17:51.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《对了 真月给我的那张卡》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.28,0:17:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.98,0:18:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！ 我要沸腾起来了 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.25,0:18:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.24,0:18:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.43,0:18:14.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要赢啊 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.07,0:18:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤V·萨拉曼达。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.27,0:18:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}V·萨拉曼达召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.63,0:18:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.11,0:18:30.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤希望皇 霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.22,0:18:34.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!? 让霍普复活的卡!?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧！ 希望皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.74,0:18:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.62,0:18:47.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}限定型异热同心力 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.21,0:18:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡能将超量怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.39,0:18:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进化成混沌超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.96,0:18:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用希望皇 霍普
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.80,0:18:59.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.56,0:19:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量 变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.27,0:19:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.39
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.62,0:19:10.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇 霍普雷V！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.96,0:19:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普雷V！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.80,0:19:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我进一步发动V salamander的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.11,0:19:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这只怪兽装备到霍普雷V上。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}salamander cross！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.40,0:19:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！我发动霍普雷V的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.25,0:19:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗一个混沌叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.68,0:19:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏场上的1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.29,0:19:52.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将其攻击力数值的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.23,0:19:53.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对方玩家！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.86,0:19:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.71,0:19:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的场上 有3只怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.80,0:20:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我还要发动V沙拉曼达的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.54,0:20:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将霍普雷V的效果对象 变为对手场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.93,0:20:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.06,0:20:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!? 我场上的 所有怪兽!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.45,0:20:15.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.69,0:20:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有3只攻击力2500的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.85,0:20:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 是7500的伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.72,0:20:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！ 霍普雷V！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.42,0:20:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}V沙拉曼达·地狱！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.56,0:20:32.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能！ 我的怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.55,0:20:43.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞 我赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.86,0:20:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了～！ 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.87,0:20:48.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人家要小鹿乱撞了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.69,0:20:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}V沙拉曼达… 真是一张不得了的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.68,0:21:01.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样！ 我和星光体的力量见识到了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.00,0:21:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)游马君！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.06,0:21:14.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.45,0:21:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君 我这是为你好…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.86,0:21:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.92,0:21:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.22,0:21:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我怎么可能败给你们这种家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.29,0:21:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为你的替代这家伙我就带走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.94,0:21:30.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.32,0:21:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.24,0:21:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想救这家伙的话就去问卡片吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.89,0:21:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.66……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.52,0:21:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙将成为我们再会的关键。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.96,0:21:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.07,0:21:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.02,0:21:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.19,0:21:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.28,0:21:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在哪!? 真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.94,0:22:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底去哪了啊!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.93,0:22:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.43,0:23:43.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
